{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/about/layout,_N_T_/about/page,_N_T_/about"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/425a3dbf0c710ad2.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/3495b70fd5675534.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-2259f70931fc362a.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/fd9d1056-b7d2ccc9acf1b254.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2117-3c035ddb30ec9f8b.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-923b7af4f22a56b0.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2972-09d07a83e49c7939.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/about/page-e9755599adf239a5.js\" async=\"\"></script><title>Modern Blog | Insightful Stories</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"A beautiful blog platform built with Next.js and Sanity CMS\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><main><header class=\"Header_header__MvnS2 glass\"><div class=\"Header_container__L4JQR container\"><a class=\"Header_logo__j7oID\" href=\"/\"><span>AARI</span>BLOG</a><nav class=\"Header_nav__EE71E\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a><a href=\"/blog\">Articles</a><a href=\"/gallery\">Gallery</a><a href=\"/about\">About</a><button class=\"Header_cta__BKss3\">Subscribe</button></nav></div></header><main class=\"container\" style=\"padding-top:160px;padding-bottom:8rem;max-width:800px\"><h1 class=\"text-gradient\" style=\"font-size:3.5rem;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:2rem\">About <span style=\"color:var(--text-primary)\">AARI Blog</span></h1><div style=\"font-size:1.2rem;line-height:1.8;color:var(--text-secondary)\"><p style=\"margin-bottom:2rem\">The primary aim of this website is to provide all types of **Aari work traces** which can be effortlessly drawn through the **Aari Android App**.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:2rem\">We specialize in providing high-quality digital patterns specifically optimized for mobile-to-cloth tracing. Whether you are looking for intricate bridal necklines or simple floral borders, our traces are designed to be used with our unique app interface.</p><h2 style=\"color:var(--text-primary);font-size:2rem;margin-top:4rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem\">The App Experience</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom:2rem\">Our upcoming Android app introduces a revolutionary way to embroider. By selecting a design from our blog and using the app&#x27;s **Lock Interface** feature, you can place your phone directly under your cloth and trace with pinpoint accuracy.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:2rem\">You can even write custom names or text on the app&#x27;s canvas and project them onto your fabric, making personalization easier than ever before.</p></div></main><footer style=\"padding:4rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);text-align:center;color:var(--text-muted);font-size:0.9rem\"><div class=\"container\"><p>© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> AARI BLOG. Built for excellence.</p></div></footer></main><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-2259f70931fc362a.js\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0]);self.__next_f.push([2,null])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/425a3dbf0c710ad2.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n2:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/3495b70fd5675534.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"3:I[12846,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n5:I[72972,[\\\"2972\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2972-09d07a83e49c7939.js\\\",\\\"7301\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/about/page-e9755599adf239a5.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\n6:I[4707,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n7:I[36423,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n9:I[61060,[],\\\"\\\"]\\na:[]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"0:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3\\\",null,{\\\"buil